@AemEnersolSync_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237

### Login + GetPlatformWellActual + upsert
POST {{AemEnersolSync_HostAddress}}/api/sync/actual
Accept: application/json

### Login + GetPlatformWellDummy + upsert (proves the changed payload is tolerated)
POST {{AemEnersolSync_HostAddress}}/api/sync/dummy
Accept: application/json

### List the stored platforms
GET {{AemEnersolSync_HostAddress}}/api/platforms
Accept: application/json

### One platform with its wells
GET {{AemEnersolSync_HostAddress}}/api/platforms/11
Accept: application/json

### List wells, optionally for a single platform
GET {{AemEnersolSync_HostAddress}}/api/wells?platformId=11
Accept: application/json

###
